#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707100 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31a0c3f1-4d07-5f81-b8c9-fe540f580384" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756029} {:answer/id #uuid "fac40e09-78dc-5ba1-b2d9-212ea02d1f72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756030}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31a0c3f1-4d07-5f81-b8c9-fe540f580384" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756029} :answer-field/id #uuid "b90baa65-8cd3-5ec1-ac5f-443c3a97ac45" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756028} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a6a348b-8d6b-5967-b4b5-0f995517afdb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756032} {:answer/id #uuid "06e16b5e-3d48-577b-b6a9-5325e17dfb90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756033}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0a6a348b-8d6b-5967-b4b5-0f995517afdb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756032} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ef3ed06-bd2f-5d2c-97b3-6600e1dcc16e" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756031} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b2e47d8a-067f-5b8a-b53b-e167fd926906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756035} {:answer/id #uuid "52bd3cd1-590a-5e2c-b64a-56b724b306e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756036}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b2e47d8a-067f-5b8a-b53b-e167fd926906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756035} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e4f8b26-3549-586d-85a8-50fc4263aa00" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756034}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "e61a5a49-da6c-5142-a7cd-02238a62d768" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\ne\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1}-2x_{2} &=0 \\\\ -2x_{2}-x_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nChoose one coefficient nonzero and solve the remaining coordinate equations by substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{2}&=1 \\\\ x_{1}-2(1)&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=2 \\\\ -2(1)-x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives a nontrivial solution. Verify it directly:\n\n$$\n2\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}-2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nThe coefficients are not all zero, so the set is **linearly dependent**.\n\nA failed candidate alone does not prove independence; the homogeneous-equation argument settles the classification.\n\nThe statement “$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **false**. The statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **false**. The statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is **false**."}]}
